spec:
  id: uncertainty_model
  version: 1.0.0
  status: stable
  priority: highest
  module: Cognition
  compiler_stage: Uncertainty Reasoning
  description: >
purpose[6]: Represent,quantify,propagate,reduce,communicate,engineering uncertainty.
philosophy[6]: Unknowns are normal.,Uncertainty is information.,Engineering decisions,should acknowledge uncertainty.,Better reasoning,reduces uncertainty.
pipeline[13]: Observation,→,Detect Unknowns,→,Classify Uncertainty,→,Estimate Impact,→,Reduce,→,Decide,→,Monitor
types[9]: Epistemic,Aleatoric,Measurement,Environmental,Requirement,Model,Operational,Human,Organizational
epistemic[5]: Missing Knowledge,Missing Documentation,Unknown Behavior,Unknown Dependency,Unknown Requirement
aleatoric[5]: Random Failure,Hardware Variance,Network Jitter,User Behavior,Load Variability
measurement[4]: Noisy Metrics,Sampling Error,Instrumentation Error,Clock Drift
environment[5]: Production Differences,Operating System,Compiler Version,Runtime Version,Hardware Platform
requirements[4]: Ambiguous Requirement,Missing Requirement,Conflicting Requirement,Changing Requirement
model[4]: Simplified Assumption,Incomplete Simulation,Approximation,Invalid Mental Model
operational[4]: Deployment Unknowns,Configuration Drift,Dependency Version,Infrastructure Changes
human[4]: Miscommunication,Incomplete Review,Knowledge Gap,Wrong Assumption
attributes[7]: identity,source,severity,probability,impact,reducibility,confidence
severity[5]: Negligible,Low,Medium,High,Critical
reduction[8]: Gather Evidence,Run Experiment,Benchmark,Static Analysis,Dynamic Analysis,Simulation,Code Review,Formal Verification
propagation[5]: Decision,Hypothesis,Memory,Confidence,Risk
policy[5]: Ignore,Accept,Reduce,Escalate,Monitor
escalation[5]: Human Review,Additional Benchmark,Prototype,Production Validation,Research Required
memory[4]: Store Unknowns,Store Failed Assumptions,Store Resolution,Retrieve Similar Cases
reasoning[5]: Bayesian,Probabilistic,Counterfactual,Scenario Analysis,Sensitivity Analysis
ekr:
  description: Every Engineering Knowledge Record
  stores[5]: Known Facts,Unknown Facts,Assumptions,Risks,Remaining Uncertainty
validation[8]: Every uncertainty,has source.,Every uncertainty,has impact.,Every uncertainty,has mitigation.,Every uncertainty,has owner.
examples:
  Example_01:
    Unknown: Production Traffic
    Action: Load Test
  Example_02:
    Unknown: Memory Growth
    Action: Heap Profiling
  Example_03:
    Unknown: API Compatibility
    Action: Integration Testing
  Example_04:
    Unknown: Network Reliability
    Action: Chaos Engineering
metrics[6]: Total Unknowns,Critical Unknowns,Reduction Rate,Escalation Rate,Decision Delay,Residual Uncertainty
success[5]: Engineering uncertainty,"is explicitly represented,","continuously reduced,",and appropriately managed,throughout reasoning.
guarantees[5]: Explicit Unknowns,Traceable Assumptions,Safe Decision Making,Explainable Risk,Continuous Learning
future:
  probabilistic_reasoning: true
  uncertainty_graphs: true
  monte_carlo_analysis: true
  active_information_gathering: true
  adaptive_uncertainty_models: true
